[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_AUTO_TRADE]
Trade Center

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_AUTO_TRADE_desc]
The §YTrade Center§! allows you to convert excess resources into credits and use those credits to acquire resources you need.
Each §Ytrade center§! you control ([?ROOT.VAR_NUM_TRADE_CENTERS_OWNED|G0] currently) increases your trading capacity by [?ROOT.VAR_TRADE_CENTER_LIMIT_PER|Y0] points.
How it works:
- Sell resources to earn Resource Exchange Credits (RECs)
- Use RECs to purchase other resources
- Each resource type has its own REC cost
- Your total trading activity cannot exceed your trade center capacity
Trading Status:
- Current trading activity: [?ROOT.VAR_TRADE_CENTER_CREDIT_MAX|G0]/[?ROOT.VAR_TRADE_CENTER_LIMIT|Y0]
- RECs remaining from selling resources: [?ROOT.VAR_TRADE_CENTER_CREDIT|G0]

[en.PIHC_TRADE_COMPLEX_TOOLTIP]
Resource exchange limit: §G+6§!

[en.PIHC_TRADE_DYNAMIC_MODIFIER]
Trade Center Resource Exchange

